        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fog of World（推定）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "世界迷雾（估算）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For reporting a problem: you see the whole report before sharing it. It has no coordinates or place names.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "問題を報告するときに使います。共有する前にレポート全体を確認できます。座標や地名は含まれません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于反馈问题：分享前可以先看完整份报告。报告里不含坐标和地名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始日"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPX files and diagnostic reports are made only when you export or share them, and go only where you send them. Diagnostic reports have no coordinates or place names.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPX ファイルと診断レポートは、あなたが書き出しや共有をしたときにだけ作られ、送り先もあなたが選んだところだけです。診断レポートには座標や地名は含まれません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPX 文件和诊断报告只在你导出或分享时才生成，也只会发到你选择的地方。诊断报告里不含坐标和地名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden": {
